# Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem OAuth credentials
# Register at https://dataspace.copernicus.eu → User Settings → OAuth Clients
# Needed only to DOWNLOAD fresh imagery. The bundled demo AOIs (Nairobi National
# Park, Karura Forest Reserve) run from pre-cached imagery in data/demo/ and need
# no credentials.
# For Streamlit Cloud, add these under App Settings → Secrets instead.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values. Do NOT commit real secrets.

CDSE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here
CDSE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret-here
